#### **Step 2: SQL Queries**

**A. List all the member names who have taken a book on 8-10-2007**

```sql
SELECT M.MemberName
FROM Member M
JOIN Issue I ON M.MemberCode = I.MemberCode
WHERE I.IssueDate = TO_DATE('2007-10-08', 'YYYY-MM-DD');
```

This query joins the **Member** and **Issue** tables to find all the members who took a book on 8th October 2007.

---

**B. List the member codes of the members who have taken books worth more than Rs. 400.00**

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT I.MemberCode
FROM Issue I
JOIN Book B ON I.BookCode = B.BookCode
WHERE B.Cost > 400;
```

This query finds the member codes of all members who have taken books worth more than Rs. 400.

